==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]].
*Infinite [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Kid Tappa]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 76.67~80 seconds<sup>2,300f~2,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Ribbo]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Project A]] spawns after 140 seconds<sup>4,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Lure the enemies close to your base so the Surge Base can't reach your cats, then use [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] cats such as [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] and talented [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to kill/[[Slow|slow]] them. Remember to bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] for the UltraBaaBaas, like [[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|Loincloth Cat]] or [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]]. Since there are several backliners, [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]] is good for killing them with his [[Long Distance]] ability.

